/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 172 0 R
/T (Communication with ROS The microcontroller creates a ROS node, then a subscriber is created to read the set point. Two publishers are created: one packages time, set point, control signal, and motor speed for later analysis. The other only publishes the motor speed for analysis in an RQT plot.)
/E (Communication with ROS The microcontroller creates a ROS node, then a subscriber is created to read the set point. Two publishers are created: one packages time, set point, control signal, and motor speed for later analysis. The other only publishes the motor speed for analysis in an RQT plot.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
