/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (Based on the step response and the metrics obtained, it can be concluded that the implemented controller exhibits good overall performance. The system shows a fast response, with a rise time of 0.07 s, and no overshoot, indicating stable behavior. Furthermore, the settling time of 1.97 s shows that the system stabilizes within a relatively short period.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (In addition, the steady-state error is practically zero, demonstrating that the controller is capable of tracking the reference with high accuracy once steady state is reached. Taken together, these results indicate that the controller design and implementation adequately meet the control objectives set for the system.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
