757 0 obj
<<
/Title (Communication with ROS The microcontroller creates a ROS node, then a subscriber is created to read the set point. Two publishers are created: one packages time, set point, control signal, and motor speed for later analysis. The other only publishes the motor speed for analysis in an RQT plot.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 759 0 R
/Next 755 0 R
>>
endobj
