759 0 obj
<<
/Title (PWM signal generation The control signal obtained from the PID is converted into a PWM duty cycle that regulates the motor speed. The direction of rotation was determined by the sign of the set point)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 758 0 R
/Next 757 0 R
>>
endobj
